    "background_story": "Virginia was a true Renaissance woman, with a career that defied categorization. By day, she was a brilliant computer scientist, specializing in artificial intelligence and machine learning. By night, she transformed into a captivating jazz singer, weaving together intricate melodies and lyrics. But that was not all - Virginia was also an accomplished painter, using vibrant colors to capture the essence of the world around her. Her polymorphic nature allowed her to seamlessly switch between these personas, each one informing and enriching the others. As a scientist, she approached music with a logical precision, while her artistic side infused her coding with creativity. Virginia's unique blend of talents made her a sought-after collaborator, and her work continues to inspire others to explore the intersections between art and science.",
